OL,3,GNEWSAStorm Boelo brings more wind and
OL,4,Arain to South East
OL,5,
OL,6,FStrong winds and rain have been lashing
OL,7,Fthe South East after the UK's second
OL,8,Fnamed storm of the weekend rolled in.
OL,10,FA yellow warning for rain is in place
OL,11,Funtil 23:00 BST across the region as
OL,12,FStorm Boelo brought more wet and windy
OL,13,Fweather, just one day after Storm
OL,14,FAusten hit.
OL,16,FThe Met Office warned the storm could
OL,17,Fpresent a danger to life from flying
OL,18,Fdebris and crashing waves, adding that
OL,19,Fpeople should stay indoors as much as
OL,20,Fpossible.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
